# OS/2 Warp 4.52 - BeagleBone Black (TI AM335x) boot environment
#
# Generated by CMake from bootloader/bbb_uEnv.txt.in. Copy this file and
# @KERNEL_IMAGE@ to the first (FAT) partition of a microSD card that also
# holds BeagleBoard.org's MLO + u-boot.img, then power on while holding the
# S2 (BOOT) button. U-Boot imports uEnv.txt and runs uenvcmd.
#
# The image is not position-independent: it must be loaded at
# @KERNEL_LOAD_ADDR@ (kernel/bbb_linker.ld). bootz needs a device tree
# argument, so U-Boot's own control DT is passed; the kernel ignores it.
#
# To boot by hand from the U-Boot prompt instead:
#   load mmc 0:1 @KERNEL_LOAD_ADDR@ @KERNEL_IMAGE@
#   bootz @KERNEL_LOAD_ADDR@ - ${fdtcontroladdr}
os2_addr=@KERNEL_LOAD_ADDR@
os2_image=@KERNEL_IMAGE@
uenvcmd=echo Booting OS/2 Warp (${os2_image}) ...; load mmc 0:1 ${os2_addr} ${os2_image} && bootz ${os2_addr} - ${fdtcontroladdr}
